@startuml
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "User" as user
participant "MealsPlanner / GroceryList\n(Angular UI)" as UI
participant "MealPrepService\n(Angular Service)" as Service
participant "Auth Middleware" as AuthMW
participant "ShoppingList Routes\n(Express)" as Routes
participant "MealPrepPlan Model" as PlanModel
participant "ShoppingList Model" as ListModel
database "MongoDB" as DB

== Scenario A: Consolidate & Append Meal Plan to Shopping List ==
user -> UI : Clicks "🛒 Add to Shopping List" on Meal Plan
UI -> Service : appendPlanToShoppingList(planId)
Service -> AuthMW : POST /api/shopping-list/append-plan (JWT)
AuthMW -> Routes : Validates JWT & User Context

Routes -> PlanModel : findById(planId).populate('recipes.recipeId')
PlanModel -> DB : Fetch Plan with Populated Recipes
DB --> PlanModel : MealPrepPlan Document

Routes -> ListModel : findOne({ userId })
ListModel -> DB : Fetch User ShoppingList
DB --> ListModel : ShoppingList Document

loop For Each Recipe Ingredient in Plan
    Routes -> Routes : Calculate Portion Multiplier (plannedPortions / basePortions)
    Routes -> Routes : Find Existing Item Match by Name/ID + Unit
    
    alt Match Found & Item is Unchecked (isChecked == false)
        Routes -> Routes : Sum Scaled Quantity and Weight onto Existing Item
    else Match Found & Item is Checked (isChecked == true)
        Routes -> Routes : Replace Quantity/Weight with New Scaled Value & Set isChecked = false
    else No Match Found
        Routes -> Routes : Append New ShoppingListItem at orderIndex++
    end
end

Routes -> ListModel : save()
ListModel -> DB : Persist Consolidated Shopping List
DB --> ListModel : Updated List
Routes --> Service : 200 OK { message, list }
Service --> UI : Display Success Toast

== Scenario B: Add Custom Manual Item ==
user -> UI : Types "Paper Towels", Qty: 2, Unit: "packs" & Hits Enter
UI -> Service : addManualItem("Paper Towels", 2, "packs")
Service -> Routes : POST /api/shopping-list/item
Routes -> ListModel : Push Manual Item & Save to DB
ListModel -> DB : Update ShoppingList Document
DB --> ListModel : Updated List Document
Routes --> Service : 201 Created { list }
Service --> UI : Refocus Name Input Field for Fast Consecutive Entry

== Scenario C: Check / Uncheck Item & Reorder ==
user -> UI : Checks Checkbox on "Broccoli"
UI -> Service : toggleShoppingItem(itemId, isChecked = true)
Service -> Routes : PATCH /api/shopping-list/item/:itemId { isChecked: true }
Routes -> ListModel : Mark Subdocument Modified & Save
ListModel -> DB : Update Item Checked State
DB --> ListModel : Saved Document
Routes --> Service : 200 OK { list }
Service --> UI : Move Item to "Checked Off" Section
@endluml